- [Restrict access to an AWS Elemental MediaStore origin](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-mediastore.md): Restrict access to an AWS Elemental MediaStore origin with Amazon CloudFront origin access control (OAC).
