- [Restrict access to an Amazon S3 origin](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-s3.md): Restrict access to an Amazon S3 origin with Amazon CloudFront origin access control (OAC).
- [Restrict access with VPC origins](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-vpc-origins.md): Learn how to use CloudFront VPC origins to restrict access to an Application Load Balancer, Network Load Balancer, or EC2 instance.
- [Restrict access to an Amazon S3 Multi-Region Access Point origin](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-s3-mrap.md): Restrict access to an Amazon S3 Multi-Region Access Point origin with Amazon CloudFront origin access control (OAC).
